  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>Field gun platoons crew rotary autocannons that spin multiple barrels to achieve extreme rates of fire. The rotary mechanism sustains a volume of ballistic fire that no single-barrel weapon can match, shredding light vehicles and suppressing entire infantry formations with sustained bursts. The trade-off is severe: rotary autocannons consume ammunition at alarming speed and generate significant heat, demanding careful fire discipline and well-stocked supply lines to sustain operations beyond initial contact.</p>"
